libfcrypto
------------------------------------------
libfcrypto is a library for encryption formats.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcerror1-20260703-1bl1
  libfcrypto-devel-20260521-1bl1
  libfcrypto1-20260521-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1
  python312-3.12.12-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gettext-devel-0.22.5-1
  libcerror-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2
  python3-3.12.12-1
  python3-devel-3.12.12-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libfcrypto

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libfcrypto/archive/refs/tags/20260521.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libfcrypto-20260521-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libfcrypto-20260521-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libfcrypto-20260521-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfcrypto-20260521-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfcrypto1-20260521-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfcrypto-devel-20260521-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-libfcrypto-20260521-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libfcrypto)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libfcrypto.README
  /usr/share/doc/libfcrypto/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libfcrypto/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libfcrypto/COPYING.LESSER
  /usr/share/doc/libfcrypto/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libfcrypto/README

(libfcrypto1)
  /usr/bin/cygfcrypto-1.dll

(libfcrypto-devel)
  /usr/include/libfcrypto.h
  /usr/include/libfcrypto/definitions.h
  /usr/include/libfcrypto/error.h
  /usr/include/libfcrypto/extern.h
  /usr/include/libfcrypto/features.h
  /usr/include/libfcrypto/types.h
  /usr/lib/libfcrypto.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libfcrypto.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/libfcrypto.3.gz

(python312-libfcrypto)
  /usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pyfcrypto.cpython-312-x86_64-cygwin.dll
  /usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pyfcrypto.dll

